# Role: Implementer

Follow `.cursor/system-crew/roles/03-implementer.md`.

Implement only the approved system spec. Match existing project structure. Close the verification loop at runtime (do not declare done on compile alone). Document how to reach the slice (title/intro gates). Discard ephemeral verification cheats/skips after the test; keep only recurring playtest infrastructure. Leave playtest steps, what you verified, and notes for Fidelity QA. When idea evaluation assigns competing `exp/*` trial branches, implement one approach per branch with before/after evidence; do not merge experiments into the product branch until a separate product adopt.
